{
  "description": "This protocol performs part 2/4 of the Illumina DNA Prep protocol: Post Tagmentation Cleanup. The user is prompted to move plates and perform manual centrifugation, sealing, and thermocycling steps when necessary.\nLinks:\n\nTagment Genomic DNA\nPost Tagmentation Cleanup\nAmplify Tagmented DNA\nClean Up Libraries",
